-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/13 (19.8.2025): תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ה
-- The one-time grant to upper-division teachers in the schools ranked
-- highest for their achievements in תשפ"ה: who, how much, when, and how it
-- is treated for pension and other purposes.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months from September
-- 2024 (common.l4's numbering: August 2025 = 12; September 2025 = 13).

§ `תשפ"ה/13 תגמול בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (19.8.2025), reference, addressee and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 with the secondary teachers' union, approved by the Treasury's wage supervisor.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: what the agreement contains (the Oz LaTmura reform in upper divisions and rules for all their teaching staff).

DECLARE `achievement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owning body` HAS `reimbursement` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

-- The circular's purpose (preamble) and section 1: teaching staff in the
-- upper division employed by supervised owning bodies of secondary
-- education in תשפ"ה, by their share of employment in the upper division,
-- whether or not they joined Oz LaTmura (section 36 of the agreement).
@ref akn:preamble/p15 akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN `graded as teaching staff in the upper division` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed by a supervised owning body of secondary education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` `graded as teaching staff in the upper division` `employed by a supervised owning body of secondary education` IF
    `graded as teaching staff in the upper division` AND `employed by a supervised owning body of secondary education`

§§ `2 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר`

-- The ranking the Ministry's examination produces (2.ב), by the rules of
-- the 2012 letter (2.א), which is not in the corpus; a school's place in it
-- is an input here.
DECLARE `school grade` IS ONE OF
    @desc the 10% highest
    `grade 1`
    @desc the next 10%
    `grade 2`
    @desc the next 10%
    `grade 3`
    @desc the next 10%
    `grade 4`
    @desc not among the schools found highest
    `not ranked`

DECLARE `school structure` IS ONE OF
    `four-year school`
    `three-year school`
    `six-year school`

@desc The teacher's employment in the excelling school in תשפ"ה.
DECLARE `achievement case` HAS
    `school grade of the case`                 IS A `school grade`
    `position fraction in the upper division`  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in the upper division
    `share of the year employed`               IS A NUMBER  @desc the part of school year תשפ"ה employed in the excelling school, counting maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law as employed (2.ג)
    `full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc the teacher was on sabbatical or unpaid leave for the whole of תשפ"ה

-- 2.א: the programme rewards teachers for achievements (academic, social
-- and of values) in the upper divisions — grades 9 to 12/14 in a four-year
-- school, 10 to 12/14 in a three-year or six-year school — and is applied
-- from school year תשע"ג in the format and by the rules of the letter of
-- the then head of the pedagogical administration, Michal Cohen, of
-- 21.10.2012, which is not in the corpus.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN s IS A `school structure`, `school grade number` IS A NUMBER @desc the class's grade, 9 for ט' up to 14 for י"ד
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the class is in the upper division the programme covers` s `school grade number` IF
        `school grade number` AT LEAST (IF s EQUALS `four-year school` THEN 9 ELSE 10)
    AND `school grade number` AT MOST 14

-- 2.ב: the teachers in the upper divisions whose achievements the Ministry
-- examined and found highest receive a one-time grant; the table gives it
-- at 100% of a position, updated to May 2025 by the consumer price index
-- against May 2024.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10 akn:art_2__para_b/p11 akn:art_2__para_b/p12
GIVEN g IS A `school grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant at a full position` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `grade 1` THEN 9745.19
    WHEN `grade 2` THEN 7308.90
    WHEN `grade 3` THEN 4872.60
    WHEN `grade 4` THEN 3654.44
    WHEN `not ranked` THEN 0

-- The table's rank column: the highest 10% of schools are grade 1 and each
-- next 10% the next grade, down to grade 4.
GIVEN `school's achievement percentile from the top` IS A NUMBER @desc the school's place in the Ministry's ranking under the 2012 letter, as a percentile counted from the top (0.05 = within the highest 5%)
GIVETH A `school grade`
DECIDE `the school's grade` `school's achievement percentile from the top` IS
    BRANCH IF `school's achievement percentile from the top` AT MOST 0.1 THEN `grade 1`
           IF `school's achievement percentile from the top` AT MOST 0.2 THEN `grade 2`
           IF `school's achievement percentile from the top` AT MOST 0.3 THEN `grade 3`
           IF `school's achievement percentile from the top` AT MOST 0.4 THEN `grade 4`
           OTHERWISE `not ranked`

-- 2.ג: part-time and/or part of the year (unpaid leave or sabbatical for
-- part of it included, maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law
-- excluded for its own period, but not unpaid leave after it): the
-- proportional share. 2.ד: no employment beyond 100% is counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_d
GIVEN c IS AN `achievement case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the proportional share` c IS
    min (c's `position fraction in the upper division`) 1
        TIMES min (c's `share of the year employed`) 1

-- 2.ג, second paragraph: a full year of sabbatical or unpaid leave: no grant.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c/p2
GIVEN c IS AN `achievement case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excluded by a full year of leave` c IF
    c's `full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`

§§§ `2 The achievement grant, assembled`

-- The table's grant (2.ב) by the proportional share (2.ג, 2.ד), and none
-- after a full year of sabbatical or unpaid leave (2.ג).
@export The one-time achievement grant an upper-division teacher is paid for school year תשפ"ה under circular תשפ"ה/13
GIVEN c IS AN `achievement case` @desc the school's grade and the teacher's position and period in it
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `achievement grant` c IS
    IF `excluded by a full year of leave` c
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the grant at a full position` (c's `school grade of the case`) TIMES `the proportional share` c

-- 2.ה: with August 2025's salary, and no later than September 2025's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN c IS AN `achievement case`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `achievement action`
DECIDE `the grant paid by September's salary` c IS
    IF `achievement grant` c GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the achievement grant` a
               PROVIDED a AT LEAST `achievement grant` c
         WITHIN 13
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/13 §2.ה: the grant is paid with August 2025's salary and no later than September 2025's"
    ELSE FULFILLED

`the month the grant is due` MEANS `month number` August

-- 2.ו: the grant is outside the base for the hourly value, severance pay and
-- percentage supplements, and carries no training-fund contributions.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f
`the grant is in the base for the hourly value, severance or percentage supplements` MEANS FALSE

@ref akn:art_2__para_f
`training-fund contributions are made on the grant` MEANS FALSE

-- 2.ז: provident-fund (pension) contributions of 5% by the employer and 5%
-- deducted from the teacher's salary.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `employer's pension contribution on the grant` grant IS grant TIMES 0.05

@ref akn:art_2__para_g
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `teacher's pension deduction from the grant` grant IS grant TIMES 0.05

-- akn:art_3 A link to the secondary-education division's site with the programme and the list of winning schools; the list is not in the corpus, so a school's grade is an input.

§§ `4 שיפוי`

-- The Ministry reimburses the owning bodies in the payments system, topic
-- 583, in August 2025's payments, transferred at the start of 9/2025.
@ref akn:art_4
GIVEN `grants paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `achievement action`
DECIDE `reimbursement in the August payments` `grants paid` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owning body` r
          PROVIDED r AT LEAST `grants paid`
    WITHIN 13
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/13 §4: reimbursement under topic 583 in the August 2025 payments, transferred early 9/2025"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples (grades and positions are placeholders; amounts are the circular's).
#ASSERT `the school's grade` 0.05 EQUALS `grade 1`
#ASSERT `the school's grade` 0.35 EQUALS `grade 4`
#ASSERT `the school's grade` 0.5 EQUALS `not ranked`
#ASSERT `the class is in the upper division the programme covers` `four-year school` 9
#ASSERT NOT `the class is in the upper division the programme covers` `six-year school` 9

`a full-time teacher in a grade-2 school` MEANS
    `achievement case` WITH
        `school grade of the case`                IS `grade 2`
        `position fraction in the upper division` IS 1.2
        `share of the year employed`              IS 1
        `full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`    IS FALSE
#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a full-time teacher in a grade-2 school` EQUALS 7308.90

`a half-time teacher half the year in a grade-1 school` MEANS
    `achievement case` WITH
        `school grade of the case`                IS `grade 1`
        `position fraction in the upper division` IS 0.5
        `share of the year employed`              IS 0.5
        `full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`    IS FALSE
#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a half-time teacher half the year in a grade-1 school` EQUALS 9745.19 TIMES 0.25

`a teacher on sabbatical all year` MEANS
    `achievement case` WITH
        `school grade of the case`                IS `grade 1`
        `position fraction in the upper division` IS 1
        `share of the year employed`              IS 0
        `full-year sabbatical or unpaid leave`    IS TRUE
#ASSERT `achievement grant` `a teacher on sabbatical all year` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `employer's pension contribution on the grant` 7308.90 EQUALS 365.445
#ASSERT `the month the grant is due` EQUALS 12

#TRACE `the grant paid by September's salary` `a full-time teacher in a grade-2 school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 7308.90 AT 12
#TRACE `reimbursement in the August payments` 7308.90 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owning body` 7308.90 AT 13
